Emacs navigation for lazyjj 0.6.1.

Upstream only configures log-tab bindings; other tabs and popups hard-code
navigation. Translate Emacs keys after text-entry handlers, reserve C-f/C-b
for tab switching, and make C-g cancel without quitting the main view.
Move push-with-new-bookmarks to M-p/M-P so C-p is safe for navigation.
Keep existing plain-key actions and navigation aliases.

The included tests run in the package's normal cargo check phase.

